# Mechanic: Choose an opponent-owned creature from their library and put it under your control.
# Forcing: Bribery is the only spell and the opponent has no eligible search result.
# AI behavior: No hand or battlefield cards interrupt resolution.
# Failure modes: A stalled empty search prevents the follow-up land play.
# Card roles: Bribery searches; Islands pay its cost; Forest proves play continues.
# Protocol path: Opponent target, library search, zone transfer, then land play.
[metadata]
